ronn-optparse-applicative(1) -- example Ronn from optparse-applicative
======================================================================

## SYNOPSIS

`ronn-optparse-applicative` [`--debug`] [`-o`\|`--output`=<FILE>] <INPUT> <COMMAND>

## OPTIONS

  * `--debug`:
    Enable debug

  * `-o`, `--output`=<FILE>:
    Output file (default "-")

  * `INPUT`:
    Input file

## COMMANDS

  * `serve`:
    Run the server

  * `build`:
    Build the project
